mploy in order to write a gospel.</note></biblStruct><bibl type="formatted" subtype="bibliography" resp="https://www.zotero.org/styles/chicago-note-bibliography-17th-edition">
  Coogan, Jeremiah. “Tatian and the Dura Fragment.” <title level="m">Early Christianity</title> 15:3 (2024): 299–321. https://doi.org/https://doi.org/10.1628/ec-2024-0021.
